<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Wood System - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Wood System - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.51		vs	   39.11</p>
<p> Operating	    1.64		vs	    1.27</p>
<p> Current		1.46		vs	    1.27</p>
<p> Net		  629    million	  vs	  568    million</p>
<p> EPS		   21.10 yen	  vs	   19.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsui Wood Systems Inc is a builder of conventional custom-built houses.</p>
</text>
